<title>PHILIPPINES: CEU sets 3.0 pesos cash dividend.</title>
<headline>CEU sets 3.0 pesos cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centro Escolar University has set a cash dividend of three pesos to shareholders on record as of June 5, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The dividend is scheduled to be paid out on June 25.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
